msgstr "VPN客户端地址段"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ipsec-vpnd.js:252
msgid ""
"Starting IP of the VPN client address pool (CIDR notation). Use a private "
"subnet that does not overlap the LAN, e.g. 10.9.8.10/24"
msgstr ""
"VPN 客户端地址池的起始地址（CIDR 记法）。使用与 LAN 不重叠的私网网段，例如 "
"10.9.8.10/24"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ipsec-vpnd.js:258
msgid "VPN Client DNS"
msgstr "VPN客户端DNS服务器"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ipsec-vpnd.js:259
msgid ""
"DNS server assigned to VPN clients. Use the VPN gateway (ipsec0) address, "
"e.g. 10.9.8.1"
msgstr ""
"分配给 VPN 客户端的 DNS 服务器。使用 VPN 网关（ipsec0）地址，例如 10.9.8.1"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ipsec-vpnd.js:275
msgid ""
"Only printable ASCII is allowed: no spaces, tabs or other control characters."
msgstr "只允许可打印 ASCII 字符：不能含空格、制表符等控制字符。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ipsec-vpnd.js:277
msgid ""
"The characters \" and \\ are not allowed: they break the ipsec.secrets "
"syntax."
msgstr "不能含 \" 与 \\：它们会破坏 ipsec.secrets 的语法。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ipsec-vpnd.js:281
msgid "Account"
msgstr "账户"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ipsec-vpnd.js:285
msgid "Password"
msgstr "密码"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ipsec-vpnd.js:290
msgid "Secret Pre-Shared Key"
msgstr "PSK密钥"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ipsec-vpnd.js:295
msgid "Enable IKEv2 (PSK + MOBIKE)"
msgstr "启用 IKEv2（PSK + MOBIKE）"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ipsec-vpnd.js:296
msgid ""
"Adds an IKEv2 connection for the native iOS/Android IKEv2 client. It "
"supports MOBIKE, so the phone keeps the tunnel while switching between Wi-Fi "
"and cellular. It authenticates with the PSK only (no username/password), so "
"use a strong PSK; existing IKEv1 clients are unaffected."
msgstr ""
"为 iOS/Android 原生 IKEv2 客户端增加一条 IKEv2 连接。它支持 MOBIKE，手机在 "
"Wi-Fi 与蜂窝网络之间切换时可保持隧道。该连接仅用 PSK 认证（不再校验账号密"
"码），请使用足够强的 PSK；原有 IKEv1 客户端不受影响。"

